  <entity00113058:ExplanationOfBorrowingsOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutBorrowingsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutBorrowingsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dTQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_FinancialInstrumentsByCurrencyAxis_dart_ForeignCurrencyMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00113058_SubordinatedBondsBorrowedFromJPMorganMerrillLynchCitiScMemberOfBorrowingsByNameMemberOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutBorrowingsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">상기 무보증 후순위사채는 발행 후 5년이 되는 시점부터 당사가 후순위사채의 전부를 상환 할 수 있습니다.</entity00113058:ExplanationOfBorrowingsOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutBorrowingsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutBorrowingsTableOfItems>
